{"id":"06104e9b3d35ed9d","group":"62","path":"62/62-df-oracle-computation.md","title":"Arithmetized Oracle Register Computation","display":"df-oracle-computation — Arithmetized Oracle Register Computation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-df-oracle-computation","aliases":["62-df-oracle-computation"],"display":"df-oracle-computation — Arithmetized Oracle Register Computation","depends_on":["[[62-df-finite-sequence]]","[[62-df-coded-function]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Lemma II.1.6; §§II.2–II.3; Definition VII.1.4","source_pages":[64,68,69,70,245],"source_pdf_pages":[82,86,87,88,263]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-df-oracle-computation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-df-oracle-computation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-oracle-computation — Arithmetized Oracle Register Computation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b7164631e6f56192\" href=\"?note=b7164631e6f56192\" title=\"62-df-finite-sequence\">62-df-finite-sequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c156c03daff0aff0\" href=\"?note=c156c03daff0aff0\" title=\"62-df-coded-function\">62-df-coded-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Lemma II.1.6; §§II.2–II.3; Definition VII.1.4"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>64</span><span>68</span><span>69</span><span>70</span><span>245</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>82</span><span>86</span><span>87</span><span>88</span><span>263</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>序列数码、分量、长度见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b7164631e6f56192\" href=\"?note=b7164631e6f56192\" title=\"62-df-finite-sequence\">62-df-finite-sequence</a>，数值配对见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c156c03daff0aff0\" href=\"?note=c156c03daff0aff0\" title=\"62-df-coded-function\">62-df-coded-function</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 为指令列代码，指令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=(d,a,u,v)\">\\(I=(d,a,u,v)\\)</span> 是长度 4 的序列数码。操作码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d=0,1,2,3\">\\(d=0,1,2,3\\)</span> 分别表示停机、增一、带零测试的减一、预言机查询。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为预言集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span> 为寄存器数，寄存器状态 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 为长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span> 的数码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 为指令地址。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}computation}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Prog}(e,b)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathsf{Seq}(e)\\land0&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(e)\\land0&lt;b\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(e)\\;[\\mathsf{Seq}(e(i))\\land\\operatorname{lh}(e(i))=4\\land e(i)(0)&lt;4\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(e(i)(0)&gt;0\\to e(i)(1)&lt;b)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(e(i)(0)\\in\\{1,3\\}\\to e(i)(2)&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(e))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(e(i)(0)=2\\to e(i)(2),e(i)(3)&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(e))]\\\\\n&amp;\\land[b=1\\lor\\exists i&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(e)\\;(e(i)(0)&gt;0\\land e(i)(1)+1=b)].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}computation}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Prog}(e,b)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathsf{Seq}(e)\\land0&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(e)\\land0&lt;b\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(e)\\;[\\mathsf{Seq}(e(i))\\land\\operatorname{lh}(e(i))=4\\land e(i)(0)&lt;4\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(e(i)(0)&gt;0\\to e(i)(1)&lt;b)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(e(i)(0)\\in\\{1,3\\}\\to e(i)(2)&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(e))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(e(i)(0)=2\\to e(i)(2),e(i)(3)&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(e))]\\\\\n&amp;\\land[b=1\\lor\\exists i&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(e)\\;(e(i)(0)&gt;0\\land e(i)(1)+1=b)].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Step}_A(e,b,q,r,q&#39;,r&#39;)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathsf{Prog}(e,b)\\land q,q&#39;&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(e)\\land\\mathsf{Seq}(r)\\land\\mathsf{Seq}(r&#39;)\\land\\operatorname{lh}(r)=\\operatorname{lh}(r&#39;)=b\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists d,a,u,v\\le e\\;[e(q)=\\langle d,a,u,v\\rangle\\land\\forall j&lt;b(j\\ne a\\to r&#39;(j)=r(j))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land((d=1\\land q&#39;=u\\land r&#39;(a)=r(a)+1)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\lor(d=2\\land((r(a)=0\\land q&#39;=u\\land r&#39;=r)\\lor(r(a)&gt;0\\land q&#39;=v\\land r&#39;(a)+1=r(a))))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\lor(d=3\\land q&#39;=u\\land r&#39;(a)&lt;2\\land(r&#39;(a)=1\\leftrightarrow r(a)\\in A)))].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Step}_A(e,b,q,r,q&#39;,r&#39;)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathsf{Prog}(e,b)\\land q,q&#39;&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(e)\\land\\mathsf{Seq}(r)\\land\\mathsf{Seq}(r&#39;)\\land\\operatorname{lh}(r)=\\operatorname{lh}(r&#39;)=b\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists d,a,u,v\\le e\\;[e(q)=\\langle d,a,u,v\\rangle\\land\\forall j&lt;b(j\\ne a\\to r&#39;(j)=r(j))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land((d=1\\land q&#39;=u\\land r&#39;(a)=r(a)+1)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\lor(d=2\\land((r(a)=0\\land q&#39;=u\\land r&#39;=r)\\lor(r(a)&gt;0\\land q&#39;=v\\land r&#39;(a)+1=r(a))))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\lor(d=3\\land q&#39;=u\\land r&#39;(a)&lt;2\\land(r&#39;(a)=1\\leftrightarrow r(a)\\in A)))].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Trace}_A(e,x,y,C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathsf{Seq}(C)\\land0&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(C)\\land\\exists b\\le e+1\\;[\\mathsf{Prog}(e,b)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists r\\le C\\;(C(0)=\\langle0,r\\rangle_N\\land\\mathsf{Seq}(r)\\land\\operatorname{lh}(r)=b\\land r(0)=x\\land\\forall j&lt;b(0&lt;j\\to r(j)=0))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(C)-1\\exists q,r,q&#39;,r&#39;\\le C\\;[C(i)=\\langle q,r\\rangle_N\\land C(i+1)=\\langle q&#39;,r&#39;\\rangle_N\\land\\mathsf{Step}_A(e,b,q,r,q&#39;,r&#39;)]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists q,r\\le C\\;[C(\\operatorname{lh}(C)-1)=\\langle q,r\\rangle_N\\land q&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(e)\\land\\mathsf{Seq}(r)\\land\\operatorname{lh}(r)=b\\land e(q)(0)=0\\land r(0)=y]],\\\\\n\\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow=y&amp;\\;:\\!\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists C\\;\\mathsf{Trace}_A(e,x,y,C),\\\\\n\\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow&amp;\\;:\\!\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists y\\;(\\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow=y),\\\\\nB\\le_T A&amp;\\;:\\!\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists e\\forall x\\exists y&lt;2\\;[(\\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow=y)\\land(y=1\\leftrightarrow x\\in B)].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Trace}_A(e,x,y,C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathsf{Seq}(C)\\land0&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(C)\\land\\exists b\\le e+1\\;[\\mathsf{Prog}(e,b)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists r\\le C\\;(C(0)=\\langle0,r\\rangle_N\\land\\mathsf{Seq}(r)\\land\\operatorname{lh}(r)=b\\land r(0)=x\\land\\forall j&lt;b(0&lt;j\\to r(j)=0))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(C)-1\\exists q,r,q&#39;,r&#39;\\le C\\;[C(i)=\\langle q,r\\rangle_N\\land C(i+1)=\\langle q&#39;,r&#39;\\rangle_N\\land\\mathsf{Step}_A(e,b,q,r,q&#39;,r&#39;)]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists q,r\\le C\\;[C(\\operatorname{lh}(C)-1)=\\langle q,r\\rangle_N\\land q&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(e)\\land\\mathsf{Seq}(r)\\land\\operatorname{lh}(r)=b\\land e(q)(0)=0\\land r(0)=y]],\\\\\n\\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow=y&amp;\\;:\\!\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists C\\;\\mathsf{Trace}_A(e,x,y,C),\\\\\n\\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow&amp;\\;:\\!\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists y\\;(\\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow=y),\\\\\nB\\le_T A&amp;\\;:\\!\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists e\\forall x\\exists y&lt;2\\;[(\\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow=y)\\land(y=1\\leftrightarrow x\\in B)].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>指令四元组用 Seq 编码，状态二元组用数值配对；两者不混同。条件将 b 固定为至少 1、且覆盖所有实际寄存器的最小上界。每一步唯一，有限运行长度归纳给出每个输入至多一个停机输出；无效 e 没有运行。所有 Trace 检查在有限代码界内，故停机是 Σ⁰₁ 条件。序列的分量只在已验证长度时使用；减一可改写为有界前驱关系。该节点是书中相对递归概念的显式算术实现；跨书 58 的有限寄存器方案提供同类有效编号，但它的集合宇宙执行签名不能直接作为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_2\">\\(L_2\\)</span> 原子。这里没有先假定部分函数图作为集合存在。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Lemma II.1.6; §§II.2–II.3; Definition VII.1.4；纸面页 64, 68, 69, 70, 245；PDF 页 82, 86, 87, 88, 263。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-finite-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"b7164631e6f56192","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-finite-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-coded-function","status":"resolved","id":"c156c03daff0aff0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-coded-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-finite-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"b7164631e6f56192","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"序列数码、分量、长度见 [[62-df-finite-sequence]]，数值配对见 [[62-df-coded-function]]。$e$ 为指令列代码，指令 $I=(d,a,u,v)$ 是长度 4 的序列数码。操作码 $d=0,1,2,3$ 分别表示停机、增一、带零测试的减一、预言机查询。$A$ 为预言集合，$b$ 为寄存器数，寄存器状态 $r$ 为长度 $b$ 的数码；$q$ 为指令地址。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-coded-function","status":"resolved","id":"c156c03daff0aff0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"序列数码、分量、长度见 [[62-df-finite-sequence]]，数值配对见 [[62-df-coded-function]]。$e$ 为指令列代码，指令 $I=(d,a,u,v)$ 是长度 4 的序列数码。操作码 $d=0,1,2,3$ 分别表示停机、增一、带零测试的减一、预言机查询。$A$ 为预言集合，$b$ 为寄存器数，寄存器状态 $r$ 为长度 $b$ 的数码；$q$ 为指令地址。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"I=(d,a,u,v)","display":false},{"tex":"d=0,1,2,3","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}computation}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Prog}(e,b)\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathsf{Seq}(e)\\land0<\\operatorname{lh}(e)\\land0<b\\\\\n&\\land\\forall i<\\operatorname{lh}(e)\\;[\\mathsf{Seq}(e(i))\\land\\operatorname{lh}(e(i))=4\\land e(i)(0)<4\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land(e(i)(0)>0\\to e(i)(1)<b)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land(e(i)(0)\\in\\{1,3\\}\\to e(i)(2)<\\operatorname{lh}(e))\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land(e(i)(0)=2\\to e(i)(2),e(i)(3)<\\operatorname{lh}(e))]\\\\\n&\\land[b=1\\lor\\exists i<\\operatorname{lh}(e)\\;(e(i)(0)>0\\land e(i)(1)+1=b)].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Step}_A(e,b,q,r,q',r')\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathsf{Prog}(e,b)\\land q,q'<\\operatorname{lh}(e)\\land\\mathsf{Seq}(r)\\land\\mathsf{Seq}(r')\\land\\operatorname{lh}(r)=\\operatorname{lh}(r')=b\\\\\n&\\land\\exists d,a,u,v\\le e\\;[e(q)=\\langle d,a,u,v\\rangle\\land\\forall j<b(j\\ne a\\to r'(j)=r(j))\\\\\n&\\quad\\land((d=1\\land q'=u\\land r'(a)=r(a)+1)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\lor(d=2\\land((r(a)=0\\land q'=u\\land r'=r)\\lor(r(a)>0\\land q'=v\\land r'(a)+1=r(a))))\\\\\n&\\qquad\\lor(d=3\\land q'=u\\land r'(a)<2\\land(r'(a)=1\\leftrightarrow r(a)\\in A)))].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Trace}_A(e,x,y,C)\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathsf{Seq}(C)\\land0<\\operatorname{lh}(C)\\land\\exists b\\le e+1\\;[\\mathsf{Prog}(e,b)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists r\\le C\\;(C(0)=\\langle0,r\\rangle_N\\land\\mathsf{Seq}(r)\\land\\operatorname{lh}(r)=b\\land r(0)=x\\land\\forall j<b(0<j\\to r(j)=0))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall i<\\operatorname{lh}(C)-1\\exists q,r,q',r'\\le C\\;[C(i)=\\langle q,r\\rangle_N\\land C(i+1)=\\langle q',r'\\rangle_N\\land\\mathsf{Step}_A(e,b,q,r,q',r')]\\\\\n&\\land\\exists q,r\\le C\\;[C(\\operatorname{lh}(C)-1)=\\langle q,r\\rangle_N\\land q<\\operatorname{lh}(e)\\land\\mathsf{Seq}(r)\\land\\operatorname{lh}(r)=b\\land e(q)(0)=0\\land r(0)=y]],\\\\\n\\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow=y&\\;:\\!\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists C\\;\\mathsf{Trace}_A(e,x,y,C),\\\\\n\\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow&\\;:\\!\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists y\\;(\\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow=y),\\\\\nB\\le_T A&\\;:\\!\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists e\\forall x\\exists y<2\\;[(\\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow=y)\\land(y=1\\leftrightarrow x\\in B)].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"L_2","display":false}],"bytes":3904,"backlinks":[{"id":"d4d648cbb987de36","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"有效编号及停机谓词见 [[62-df-oracle-computation]]。$A,Y$ 为数的集合；$\\mathsf J$ 是标准元理论中的集合值算子，$\\mathsf{Jump}$ 是对象语言谓词。"},{"id":"e2d400eef79d26fb","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"数集之间的归约见 [[62-df-oracle-computation]]，有限标准跳跃见 [[62-df-finite-jump]]。以下是元理论中的子集族。"},{"id":"bbe854d81e43f822","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ 在标准元理论中解释；$\\le_T$ 见 [[62-df-oracle-computation]]。以下度是元层的子集族，不作为二阶算术中的集合变量。"},{"id":"0efbe3f2d5d172f3","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)$ 是元层集合族；$\\oplus$ 见 [[62-df-turing-join]]，$\\le_T$ 见 [[62-df-oracle-computation]]。"},{"id":"c68a6ecbed6addff","anchor":"ref-46","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[62-df-oracle-computation|Arithmetized Oracle Register Computation]]"},{"id":"f1525607abf065f1","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"理论见 [[62-df-RCA0]]、[[62-df-ACA0]]；Jump 见 [[62-df-jump-operator]]；算术停机编号见 [[62-df-oracle-computation]]；参数 join 见 [[62-df-turing-join]]；$\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]。"},{"id":"c183c4f51ea1c088","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"理论与 Cn 见 [[62-df-WKL0]]、[[62-df-ACA0]]、[[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]；模型与 J 见 [[62-df-omega-model]]、[[62-df-jump-operator]]，归约见 [[62-df-oracle-computation]]；ACA₀ 的 jump 闭包见 [[62-thm-ACA0-omega-models]]，KL 刻画见 [[62-thm-ACA0-Konig-equivalence]]。在元理论中，$\\mathsf{Low}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf J(A)\\le_T\\mathsf J(\\varnothing)$。"}],"outgoing":["b7164631e6f56192","c156c03daff0aff0"]}